4. f4 { Develop your other Knight! } 4... Nc6 5. Nf3 { FIanchetto your Bishop } 5... Bg7 6. Bd3 { Castle your King to safety! } 6... O-O 7. O-O { Now, counterstrike in White's center } 7... e5 8. fxe5 dxe5 9. dxe5 { This next move is hard to find! } 9... Nxe5 10. Nxe5 { Now fork White's King and Knight! } 10... Qd4+ { [%cal Gd4e5,Gd4g1] } 11. Kh1 Qxe5 *


