{ The Two Knights System is the most natural variation of the Pirc Defense! }
4. Nf3 { Pin White's Knight! } 4... Bg4 { White Defends the Pin } 5. Be2 { Fianchetto your Bishop and prepare to castle! } 5... Bg7 6. O-O O-O 7. Be3 { Play c6, preparing for d5 on your next turn! } { [%cal Gd6d5,Gc7c6] } 7... c6 8. Qd2 d5 9. exd5 cxd5 *


