{ The 150 Attack is characterised by Be3! }
4. Be3 { Black plays the silent move c6, preparing for counterplay on the Queenside } 4... c6 { White Qd2 is aiming at our Kingside Bishop, weakening Black's Kingside and preventing Black from castling } 5. Qd2 { We strike into the Queen's flank } { [%cal Ge3h6,Gd2e3] } 5... b5 *


