4. Bg5 { The Byrne Variation is characterised by Bg5, it is the most aggressive response for White! Black fianchettoes his Bishop, protecting his Knight } 4... Bg7 { White plays Qd2; he plans to play Bh6 on his next move, removing Black's Fianchettoed Bishop which is disadvantageous for Black! } 5. Qd2 { Find a way to prevent the Bishop trade! } 5... h6 6. Bf4 *


